-<div class="refsect1">
-<a name="id56564"></a><h2>Description</h2>
-<p>The function wraps a function object in order it to be able to participate in filtering expressions. The wrapped function must be compatible with the following signature:</p>
-<pre class="programlisting">
-bool (attribute_value_set const&amp; values) const
-</pre>
-<p>The wrapped function must return <code class="computeroutput">true</code> if the log record is to be passed by the filter and <code class="computeroutput">false</code> otherwise. </p>
